@startuml
title 多人共享记账系统——用例图
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

actor "用户" as User
actor "账本成员" as Member
actor "普通成员" as Normal
actor "账本管理员" as Admin
actor "审核员" as Reviewer

User <|-- Member
Member <|-- Normal
Member <|-- Admin
Member <|-- Reviewer

rectangle "多人共享记账系统" {
  usecase "注册登录与密码管理" as Login
  usecase "创建账本、接受邀请" as Create
  usecase "新增收支\n修改、撤回及重提本人未审核记录" as Record
  usecase "组合查询与收支统计" as Query
  usecase "查看结算明细" as Detail
  usecase "提交已结算错账更正申请" as Correct
  usecase "退出账本" as Exit
  usecase "查看本人相关日志" as OwnLog
  usecase "邀请成员、设置角色\n转让管理员权限" as Manage
  usecase "维护分类与预算" as Budget
  usecase "生成及确认结算" as Settle
  usecase "审核、驳回、作废记录\n审核更正申请" as Review
  usecase "查询账本操作日志" as AllLog
}

User -- Login
User -- Create
Member -- Record
Member -- Query
Member -- Detail
Member -- Correct
Member -- Exit
Member -- OwnLog
Admin -- Manage
Admin -- Budget
Admin -- Settle
Admin -- AllLog
Reviewer -- Review
Reviewer -- AllLog

note bottom of Member
  用户、账本成员用于归纳公共能力。
  实际账本角色为普通成员、管理员、审核员。
  管理员不自动获得审核员权限。
end note

note right of Review
  不得审核本人记录或更正申请。
  驳回、作废必须填写原因。
end note
@enduml
